  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued support to Africa/Asia/Latin America Scholarly              Collaborative Programme (South/South), which was initiated in 2004 by a number of social science research organisations from Africa, Asia   and Latin America with the objective of establishing close            cooperation between researchers in these regions for mutual learning  and provision of a southern perspective in the global debate.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fortsatt st&#xf6;d till Africa/Asia/Latin America Scholarly Collaborative  Programme (South/South) som startades 2004 av ett antal               samh&#xe4;llsvetenskapliga forskningsorganisationer fr&#xe5;n Afrika, Asien och Latinamerika med syftet att etablera n&#xe4;ra samarbete mellan forskare i desa regioner f&#xf6;r att l&#xe4;ra fr&#xe5;n varandra och f&#xf6;ra fram sydperspektiv  i den globala debatten om utvecklingsfr&#xe5;gor.</narrative>
  </description>
